            "step_3_description": "for 60+ minutes",
            "description": "Experience professional spa-quality facial rejuvenation with our Glass Face Cupping Set. Featuring precisely crafted glass cups with rubber pressure bulbs, this comprehensive set brings traditional spa treatments into your home for natural, visible lifting and sculpting results.\n\nYour professional face cupping set includes: 4 graduated cups in an elegant gift box: Size 1 for chest, abs, arms, and legs; Sizes 2 and 3 for face, neck, and décolletage; Size 4 for delicate eye and lip areas. Each cup is designed for specific treatment zones, allowing you to deliver the same professional-grade treatments used by estheticians in the comfort of your home.\n\nGlass cups with controlled bulb pressure offer superior lifting and toning benefits while encouraging lymphatic drainage. The precise suction control helps release muscle tension to soften fine lines, minimize pores, and activate collagen production naturally. Perfect for defining jawlines, plumping lips, lifting eyebrows, and revitalizing tired eyes. These professional-grade tools help achieve and maintain a naturally sculpted, youthful appearance."
          }
        },
